About Roam-A-Dome.rtfd/

# iCloud Drive "conflict copy" duplicates (e.g. "Foo 2.cpp", "sketch 3.yaml").
# arduino-cli compiles every .cpp under src/, so a stray "Foo 2.cpp" alongside
# "Foo.cpp" defines every symbol twice and breaks the link. Keep them out.
* [0-9].*
* [0-9]/
*.pyc
__pycache__/
releases/
docs/capture/*.log
RadFirmware/test/native/rad_tests
RadFirmware/test/native/rad_tests.dSYM/
RadFirmware/test/native/parse_cli
RadFirmware/test/native/parse_cli.dSYM/
